{
  "slug": "black-bean-tofu-burrito-bowl",
  "name": "Black bean and tofu burrito bowl",
  "description": "Spiced tofu and mushrooms with black beans, a modest scoop of brown rice, peppers, salsa and lime — everything a burrito holds, in a bowl that still hits its protein.",
  "iconKey": "bowl",
  "instructions": [
    "Crumble the tofu into the olive oil in a wide pan over medium-high heat and cook for 5 minutes without stirring, so it browns.",
    "Add the mushrooms and bell pepper and cook for 4 minutes, until the mushrooms are dry and the pepper has softened.",
    "Stir in the black beans and heat through for 2 minutes, then fold in the spinach until it wilts.",
    "Warm the brown rice and divide it between two bowls.",
    "Spoon the tofu mixture over the rice, top with the salsa and the cilantro, and squeeze the lime over."
